lancer-encounter-deep-range-fight-1-desc = Raiders are funneling through the rubble corridor. Hold the killzone — Sentinel Overwatch shines here.
lancer-encounter-deep-range-fight-1-objective = Eliminate all hostiles.
lancer-encounter-deep-range-fight-2-name = Extraction Under Fire
lancer-encounter-deep-range-fight-2-desc = Reach the extraction point while cutlass elements pin you down.
lancer-encounter-deep-range-fight-2-objective = Reach extraction hex (8, 1).
lancer-encounter-deep-range-fight-3-name = Relay Stand
lancer-encounter-deep-range-fight-3-desc = Two cutlass mechs are flanking the relay. Hold the line.
lancer-encounter-deep-range-fight-3-objective = Defend the relay and eliminate all hostiles.

lancer-encounter-crown-signal-fight-1-name = Artillery Contact
lancer-encounter-crown-signal-fight-1-desc = Bombard units are shelling the approach. Take them out.
lancer-encounter-crown-signal-fight-1-objective = Eliminate all hostiles.
lancer-encounter-crown-signal-fight-2-name = Shell Zone
lancer-encounter-crown-signal-fight-2-desc = Hold the uplink hex while bombard fire rains down.
lancer-encounter-crown-signal-fight-2-objective = Hold uplink hex (6, 5) for 3 turns.
lancer-encounter-crown-signal-fight-3-name = Veteran Assault
lancer-encounter-crown-signal-fight-3-desc = A veteran cutlass leads the final push. End this.
lancer-encounter-crown-signal-fight-3-objective = Eliminate all hostiles.

